rs, and correction pens; notebooks, exercise and drawing books, sketch pads, coloring books, wiro books, executive diaries, and conference pads; stationery kits, art material kits, painting kits, and combo packs; as well as baby diapers and wet wipes. In addition, it provides packaging services. The company was founded in 1973 and is based in Valsad, India."}}